    "created_at": "2026-01-24T07:41:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-24T07:47:09Z",
    "body": "Side note: Chrome disagrees with spec on `'` not being included:\n\n```js\nconst u = new URL('https://example.com')\nArray.from({ length: 128 }, (_, i) => String.fromCharCode(i)).slice(0x20, -1).filter((c) => (u.username = c, u.username !== c)).join('')\n```\n\nRefs: http://url.spec.whatwg.org/#set-the-username\n\n```\nNode.js:\n' \"#/:;<=>?@[\\\\]^`{|}'\n\nDeno:\n' \"#/:;<=>?@[\\\\]^`{|}'\n\nwhatwg-url:\n' \"#/:;<=>?@[\\\\]^`{|}'\n\nSafari:\n' \"#/:;<=>?@[\\\\]^`{|}'\n\nFirefox:\n' \"#/:;<=>?@[\\\\]^`{|}'\n\nChrome:\n' \"#\\'/:;<=>?@[\\\\]^`{|}'\n```\n\nThey all agree on `\\` being included though",
    "author_association": "NONE",
